cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Keyhole in your work, please cite this software."
title: "Keyhole: A Lean-verified IDOR detector for web APIs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "akshatgit"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/akshatgit/lean"
url: "https://github.com/akshatgit/lean"
abstract: >-
  Keyhole is a static analyzer for insecure direct object reference (IDOR)
  vulnerabilities in web APIs. Its authorization checker and counterexample
  validation are implemented and proved sound in Lean 4.
keywords:
  - IDOR
  - authorization
  - static analysis
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
